WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Tomorrow we will go to the place where the bison appear.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
It’s best to get two more cows, senior

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Now the grassland has withered

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Where will the bison go?

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Not sure

6
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
But they will definitely leave footprints

7
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Let's go look for it when the time comes

8
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Those bison should have been on the planet for a long time

9
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
It's a primitive species

10
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,030
Maybe they have other close local seniors

11
00:00:19,030 --> 00:00:21,030
You mean those bison have somewhere to graze?

12
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:22,030
Probably

13
00:00:22,030 --> 00:00:23,030
If you can't eat grass

14
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:24,030
How do they live?

15
00:00:24,030 --> 00:00:25,030
Can grow so big

16
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:26,030
Anyway

17
00:00:26,030 --> 00:00:28,030
You've lived for a few years, right?

18
00:00:28,030 --> 00:00:29,030
Makes sense

19
00:00:29,030 --> 00:00:31,820
It's getting late

20
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:32,820
Let's go to bed after eating

21
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:33,820
Keep up your spirits

22
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:34,820
Going to look for bison tomorrow

23
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:35,820
Wait until there is meat

24
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:38,820
It would be faster to exchange meat for wood and stone.

25
00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:41,650
What's wrong

26
00:00:41,650 --> 00:00:42,650
It can be dangerous outside at night
